  "content": "<div>\n<h2>EMIffect</h2>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>注意：经<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://modrinth.com/user/Flamarine\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flamarine</a>许可，我正在维护此 Curseforge 项目。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252ffzzyhmstrs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/85a7141b-76c9-4f0c-bd04-21f4b0d56c4a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect 托管横幅\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></strong></a></p><div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>EMIffect 是一个 EMI 扩展模组，它会在 EMI 侧边栏中添加状态效果作为可搜索的 \"幻影物品\"，并提供每个状态效果的详细信息。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>灵感来源于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Effect Descriptions</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>模组开发者可以通过语言文件为自定义状态效果添加描述。格式遵循 JEED：<code>effect.[模组ID].[效果名称].description</code>。</p>\n<h4><br>效果描述示例<br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/775184371908214785/1040180719680507934/image.png\" alt=\"游戏中 EMIffect 配方视图示例\" width=\"1663\" height=\"874\"></h4>\n<h4>EMI 侧边栏中的效果 \"堆叠\" 示例</h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/775184371908214785/1040111017717407754/image.png\" alt=\"鼠标悬停在状态效果堆叠上时显示的提示截图\" width=\"819\" height=\"334\"></p>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
